       ============================================================ -->
  <suppress>
    <notes><![CDATA[
      io.qameta.allure:* 2.34.0 (CVE-2026-33166 in allure-generator).
      Cannot bump testAllure beyond 2.34.0 — allure-cucumber7-jvm, allure-selenide, allure-junit-platform
      stop publishing at 2.34.0. allure-generator runs only as the standalone Allure report-generation CLI
      during test runs, never in deployed services.
